{"id":"a09bfd7dd9","t":"the genius wants to be ordinary","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/images.jpg","n":64,"l":64,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary"},"u":1795038370653,"desc":"بطل حياة ناجحة معترف بها من قبل الجمهور، “سون جينهيوك”. ومع ذلك، أراد جينهيوك فقط أن يعيش حياة طبيعية مع عائلته الحبيبة، ولم يستطع إخفاء قلبه الوحيد لأنه لم يستطع. ذات يوم، استيقظت في حادث وعدت إلى الوقت الذي كنت فيه في التاسعة من عمري قبل أن أفقد والدي، اللذين أردتهما كثيرًا! هل سيتمكن جينهيوك من إنقاذ والديه والعيش حياة طبيعية؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","فانتازيا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary|/manga/the-genius-wants-to-be-ordinary/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-gen